        "original_id": "a63b6c86-03c9-5290-997a-56b02fb94c72",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Encore Las Vegas, Wynn Las Vegas, Las Vegas Strip, Paradise, North Las Vegas, Las Vegas, Nevada\n- Organizations: Wynn Resorts\n- People: Steve Wynn, Tom Fazio, Carolyn Goodman\n- Roles: mayor, casino developer, real estate businessman, art collector\n- Properties: Shadow Creek Golf Course\n\nFacts:\n- Steve Wynn was born on January 27, 1942, and is an American real estate businessman and art collector.\n- Shadow Creek Golf Course is an 18-hole golf course in North Las Vegas, Nevada, designed by Tom Fazio and built by Steve Wynn in 1989.\n- Carolyn Goodman has served as the mayor of Las Vegas, Nevada since 2011.\n- Encore Las Vegas is a luxury resort, casino, and hotel on the Las Vegas Strip in Paradise, Nevada.\n- Encore Las Vegas is also called Encore at Wynn Las Vegas or simply Encore.\n- Encore Las Vegas is connected to its sister resort, Wynn Las Vegas.\n- Wynn Las Vegas and Encore Las Vegas are owned by Wynn Resorts.\n- Wynn Resorts is headed by casino developer Steve Wynn.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
